SUMMARY:Wait\, What’s Sri Lanka? - **THIS IS A COMEDY SPECIAL TAPING**
LOCATION:New York
DESCRIPTION:Buying a ticket means you consent to potentially being on camer
 a. ARRIVAL INFO:Please arrive early to be seated and experience any of the
  pre-built pre-show. We recommend showing up at least 30 minutes before sho
 w time. Once the show begins there is no late seating because the cameras w
 ill be rolling. Wait\, What’s Sri Lanka? is a one hour stand-up special\
 , written by Shenuque and directed by Sunny Laprade\, this show is for anyo
 ne who has ever felt invisible. The show explores the joy of embracing all 
 parts of your identity while navigating the pain of not feeling seen. Shenu
 que uses a narrative stand-up style to talk about their life through the le
 ns of being Sri Lankan and how that intersects with their other identities.
  The show reveals how interconnected we all are. Regardless of whether or n
 ot you're Sri Lankan\, this show is for you. Topics include race\, gender\,
  sexuality\, and of course\, aunties. If you enjoy stand-up comedy that wea
 ves together humor with a compelling narrative\, you will enjoy this show.A
 ll graphics are designed by: Elliot Davis.Music by: DJ UshkaOriginal Music
  by: Roshane KarunaratneBio:Shenuque is a Sri Lankan American comedian bor
 n and raised on Staten Island. Their stand-up is infused with a passion for
  storytelling and an enrapturing stage presence. They are currently touring
  their debut stand-up special\, Wait\, What’s Sri Lanka?\, a show for any
 one who has ever felt invisible. They’ve graced the stage in Off-Broadway
  productions and contributed their writing talents to HBO Max. They’ve wo
 rked as a director for the Murmuration Theater Company and co-founded the a
 ward-winning podcast studio Many Sided Media\, where you can regularly hear
  their voice acting on the show My First Dungeon. Audiences have said that 
 Shenuque is like if Hasan Minhaj\, Tiffany Haddish\, and John Mulaney were 
 in a polycule and didn’t let Shenuque in\, so he modeled his comedy after
  all of them.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/wait-w
 hats-sri-lanka-this-is-a-comedy-special-taping/
